{"title":"Sand Basilisk","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 26 Basilisk that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 3 times (5.8% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/sand-basilisk\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sand-basilisk?lv=26\">Lv 26 <span>41</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sand-basilisk?lv=27\">Lv 27 <span>35</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/sand-basilisk?lv=26\" title=\"Pick level 26\"><td><b>26</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>94</td><td>18.8</td><td>1,300</td><td class=\"muted\">282 · 26.3 · 3,900</td><td>41</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Thak%20Scout%20Outpost\">Thak Scout Outpost</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/sand-basilisk?lv=27\" title=\"Pick level 27\"><td><b>27</b></td><td>100</td><td>19.4</td><td>1,350</td><td class=\"muted\">300 · 27.2 · 4,050</td><td>35</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Thak%20Scout%20Outpost\">Thak Scout Outpost</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 4 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 4 looted corpses, 7 recorded drops, 315 total, 16–95 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"basilisk-hide\" title=\"Basilisk Hide - in 50% of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/92ba5da9ce736ad2f55e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Basilisk Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">50% · 2/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"petrified-eye\" title=\"Petrified Eye - in 25% of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/8ae52230f75f93b21c7e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Petrified Eye</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">25% · 1/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"werewolfpelt-legs\" title=\"Werewolfpelt Legs - in 25% of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/d665ef86050cc2f37c8d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Werewolfpelt Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">25% · 1/4</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"bodkin-bolt\" title=\"Bodkin Bolt - in 25% of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 7 total, 7 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7a2e1626588f08ce161d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bodkin Bolt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">25% · 1/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"basilisk-scale\" title=\"Basilisk Scale - in 25% of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 2 total, 2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a5ed9e1dc0e4fec30424.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Basilisk Scale</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">25% · 1/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"basilisk-hide\" title=\"Basilisk Hide - in 50% of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/92ba5da9ce736ad2f55e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Basilisk Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">50% · 2/4</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-608.0px,-625.8px)\"><img src=\"tiles/3/1/1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:256px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/1/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:512px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/2/1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:256px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/2/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:512px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/3/1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:256px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/3/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:512px\"><i style=\"left:620.5px;top:673.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:561.7px;top:695.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:567.1px;top:620.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:576.5px;top:609.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:638.7px;top:614.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:644.9px;top:629.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:562.7px;top:626.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:568.4px;top:635.0px\"></i>